sequenceDiagram
  participant G1 as G1:Primary<br/>(crashed — silent)
  participant B as B:BackupReadinessWorkflow<br/>(Temporal Child Workflow)
  participant G2_WF as G2:SatpTransferWorkflow
  participant CA as Certificate Authority

  loop Every heartbeatInterval
    G1 ->> B: heartbeat() — primary is alive
  end

  Note over G1: CRASH — heartbeats stop

  Note over B: heartbeatTimeout fires<br/>CancellationScope.withTimeout resolves

  B ->> B: Activity: ValidateBackupCertActivity<br/>[1] Run certification path algorithm on B's cert
  B ->> CA: Validate certificate chain to root
  CA -->> B: chain valid
  B ->> B: [2] B.parentCert == G1.parentCert<br/>(same legal authority / VASP CA)
  B ->> B: [3] hash(B.cert) in G1.cert.extensions.authorizedBackups

  Note over B: All 3 checks pass — B is authorized

  B ->> G2_WF: Signal: SESSION-RESUMPTION<br/>{ newGatewayPubkey: B.pubkey }
  G2_WF ->> G2_WF: Validate signal against cert checks (Query mode)
  G2_WF -->> B: Acknowledge new TLS session

  B ->> G2_WF: Signal: RECOVER<br/>{ isBackup: true, newIdentityPublicKey: B.pubkey, seqNum=N }

  Note over B,G2_WF: Resume standard crash recovery<br/>sub-protocol with B as G1
